# lexicon.tbl — the word lexicon, one entry per line
#   word | pos | japanese | extra...
#   pos: v  verb       extra = class [| past | pp]   class: g godan, i ichidan, s suru-verb, k kuru
#        n  noun       extra = noun class            class: h human, a animal, t thing, p place
#        a  i-adjective (japanese ends in い)        na  na-adjective       fx  fixed predicate (already finite)
#        adv adverb    t time word    p preposition (unused)    int interjection    conj conjunction    det determiner
#   a word with spaces is a multiword token; the lexical layer merges it by longest match over the buffer
#   plural nouns are derived (word + s/es) unless the plural has its own line

